  <jpcrp_cor:OfficialTitleOrPositionInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E03489-000IshiguroYasunoriMember">

代表取締役


社長 兼 ＣＯＯ


